Negative control for the API's own sentence reaching the user.

Drops the captured message from the failure toast, so a refusal reads as
generic copy and the business rule that caused it ("The default email cannot be
changed to unverified email address!") never reaches the person who hit it.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: action-feedback.spec.ts — the API-message case.

